# Cloudflare Pages headers. Format: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/headers/
#
# CSP keeps 'unsafe-inline' because the site has many inline <script> and
# inline style attributes (per-letter animations, IntersectionObserver setup,
# cookie consent, etc.). Migrating those to nonces requires a build-time
# rewrite and is out of scope for this hardening pass. The whitelist still
# blocks externally-loaded malicious scripts (the most common XSS payload),
# and frame-ancestors/base-uri/object-src close common pivots.
#
# The script/connect allowlist is kept tight: only jsDelivr + cdnjs (GSAP,
# Prism, Twemoji), Google Fonts, the API origin, and the two telemetry
# integrations below. Stale entries — cdn.tailwindcss.com (now build-time
# PostCSS), the Google ad domains (no ads), the origin-locked *.fly.dev, the
# unused ad frame-src, and the three public feeds the retired ANNEX D
# live-telemetry strip polled (ISS position, USGS quakes, Frankfurter FX) —
# were removed: they served no live resource and only widened the attack
# surface.
#
# Sentry (connect-src): sentry.client.config.js initialises with
# PUBLIC_SENTRY_DSN in prod, so error envelopes POST to the ingest endpoint.
# Without this entry every send is refused and client-side monitoring silently
# reports nothing. Pinned to the project's exact ingest origin rather than a
# *.ingest.us.sentry.io wildcard, so a compromised script cannot exfiltrate to
# an unrelated Sentry tenant.
#
# Cloudflare Web Analytics (script-src + connect-src): the beacon is injected
# at the edge by Web Analytics "automatic setup" — there is no reference to it
# anywhere in this repo, so grep will not explain these two entries. It needs
# BOTH: the script loads from static.cloudflareinsights.com, then POSTs its
# measurements to a DIFFERENT host, cloudflareinsights.com/cdn-cgi/rum. The
# privacy policy discloses this analytics; if the edge setting is ever turned
# off, drop these entries and that disclosure together.

/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://cdn.jsdelivr.net https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com https://static.cloudflareinsights.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://cdn.jsdelivr.net https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com https://fonts.googleapis.com; img-src 'self' data: blob: https:; font-src 'self' https://fonts.gstatic.com data:; connect-src 'self' https://api.luci-studio.com https://o4509530171113472.ingest.us.sentry.io https://cloudflareinsights.com; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; object-src 'none'; form-action 'self'
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), interest-cohort=()
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
